MODULE: NoReshardWhileMirroringAdmissionIgnoresHold
TARGET: NoReshardWhileMirroring
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: reshard starts inside the completed resize's undoable mirror window
PERTURBS: ReshardBegin

--- FIND
    /\ operation = "none" /\ ~mirror /\ ~undoable
--- REPLACE
    /\ operation = "none"
--- END
